# tvBro web: my deployment

## Update deploy
```powershell
powershell -File web\deploy\stage.ps1 -Out <dir>      # LF, ?v=<build> on CSS/JS + module imports, tar
scp -q <dir>\tvbro-web.tar <dir>\stage\deploy\update_lxc.sh root@<proxmox-host>:/tmp/
ssh root@<proxmox-host> 'pct push <ctid> /tmp/tvbro-web.tar /tmp/tvbro-web.tar; pct push <ctid> /tmp/update_lxc.sh /tmp/update_lxc.sh; pct exec <ctid> -- bash /tmp/update_lxc.sh restart'
```
Back up `state.db` first: `pct exec <ctid> -- bash -c 'cp -a /var/lib/tvbro/state.db /var/lib/tvbro/state.db.bak-$(date +%Y%m%d-%H%M%S)'`.

Site settings in the container, `/etc/default/tvbro`:
```
TVBRO_SERVER_NAME=tvbro.example.lan
TVBRO_ALLOWED_HOSTS=tvbro.example.lan
```
Encryption key: `/etc/credstore/tvbro.key` (root 0600). Keep a copy somewhere safe.

## The container
- Proxmox host: `<proxmox-host>`, container id `<ctid>`, Debian 12, unprivileged.
- Address: `<ip>/<prefix>`, gateway `<gw>`, DNS `<resolver>`.
- Cert: how it is issued and copied to `/etc/nginx/certs/tvbro/` (`fullchain.pem`, `privkey.pem` 0600).
- LAN DNS record: `tvbro.example.lan -> <ip>` on `<resolver>`.

